  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3muAV3jO\">本章节主要介绍<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1696710631271436\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取线索列表</a>与<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1696710631812096\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">回传有效线索</a>相关能力。<br/>通过API回传上报线索回访的进展状态，大数据会帮你找到更多精准用户，提升线索有效率和降低成本。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-A0ReXBaT\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OPwRzSEM\"><strong>使用流程：</strong></p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-BOiHKFdd\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PBc8T8XD\">拉取数据：将营销投放获取的线索拉取到自己的CRM中。<br/>你可以通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1696710631271436\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取线索列表</a>将通过巨量引擎营销投放获取的线索拉取到自己的CRM平台中，进行后续统计和跟踪管理。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2KinUEfK\">按规则处理数据：<br/>为了我们的投放模型可以更好地学习你的数据，进一步为你优化投放，你需要将自己CRM中需要投放模型学习的线索数据按照下面的规则进行状态标记：<br/>字段名称：clue_convert_type（线索状态）<br/>值：194:回访-信息确认、195:回访-加为好友、196:回访-高潜成交<br/>状态标记规则说明：以上3个值为线索回访的进展状态，代表有效线索逐渐加深的层级。回传时，字段值仅回传数字。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XHQHfUNZ\">回传数据：<br/>将自己CRM中处理好的数据，通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1696710631812096\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">回传有效线索</a>回传到飞鱼CRM中供投放模型学习。</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-u8ojBMCQ\">你可通过以下渠道进一步了解飞鱼CRM系统：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-IHnJcTqJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-H65VYpO6\"><a href=\"https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/home\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">飞鱼主页</a>：<a href=\"https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/home\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/home</span></a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-e9VT5Q1j\"><a href=\"https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/crm/feiyu/sales/clue-introduce-case\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">各行业深度转化案例</a>：<a href=\"https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/crm/feiyu/sales/clue-introduce-case\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/crm/feiyu/sales/clue-introduce-case%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://feiyu.oceanengine.com/pc/crm/feiyu/sales/clue-introduce-case</a></li></ul></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-DITPYVE7\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-SpbWaZYW\"><br/></p></div>",
